ving the caves with two other randoms.\n\nThank you!", "timestamp_created": 1535725090, "timestamp_updated": 1535725090, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.541984736919403076", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "44479027", "author": {"steamid": "76561198015463549", "personaname": "Darkunit", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198015463549/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 1730, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 228, "last_played": 1651204875, "avatar": "0db5a1753618379d3505db7b2aea7beefaf935ba"}, "language": "english", "review": "Having put a few hours into it I can honestly say the game has a lot of promise.  Fights can already be hectic yet enjoyable, and there is quite a bit to look for as you delve down into the dark.  As it is a co-op game, you do really need to work together to get the quests done.  I cant wait to stick with the game as it develops.", "timestamp_created": 1535687917, "timestamp_updated": 1535687917, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.525862038135528564", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}]}